((date 2026-11-14) (slug stale-e-cap-k5)
 (hypothesis
  "Stale-E entry cap, K = 5 paired 26y (pre-registered in dev/experiments/stale-e-cap-k5-2026-11-14/README.md at aab060262, #3608). C = record config + entry_cap_local_range_weeks 4: a long ticket's trigger E becomes min(E, 4-week high x 1.005) and the 15 % stop gate reads the capped E', so names S's gate rejects can be admitted. G = C + entry_cap_stop_gate_on_uncapped (#3609): the gate reads the uncapped E, so only re-pricing and re-sizing remain. Each paired with S (record config, Seeded tie order K), K = 0..4, top-3000 PIT v12 deduped lists 2000-2026. Per pair, in order: validity (V6 exit 0, tripwire S = #3595 S md5, n_symbols_absent=1, S capped 0; for G the G check, no capped G ticket on an S stop-gate skip, bar 0); liveness L (capped share of placed long tickets) >= 10 % and F (capped pairs filled lower) >= 50 % over >= 30 pairs; return median delta ln(1+R) against delta = max(0.20, m_S): pass >= delta with all but one seed > 0, harm <= -delta with all but one < 0; same-ticket effect D = M + RC - RS on capped keys both arms placed, bar D > 0 in all but one seed; ESCALATE also needs arm-median maxDD gap <= 3.0 pp and trim-3 total > 0 in all but one seed. Outcome, first match: NO-BUILD (D > 0 in <= 1 seed with median < delta, or the harm bar), ESCALATE, KEEP-AXIS (the D bar, median inside the band), else INCONCLUSIVE. C vs G is attribution only (admissions add / cost / unresolved); combined table: G INVALID / BOTH PASS / LEVER NOT ADMISSIONS / ADMISSIONS / NEITHER PASSES.")
 (base_scenario
  "stale-e-cap-k5-2026-11-14: 15 cells (S/C/G x k0-k4) at HEAD aab060262, image sha256:3865e48e8a61, warehouse v12wk-9236 + corpact-2026-10-27 + bars data-20261102, five Claude cloud sessions launched 2026-11-14 13:54Z; TRIPWIRE MATCH 5/5 and PARITY identical (S = #3595 pb-S byte for byte); validator_diff -check V6 exit 0 on all ten pairs; n_symbols_absent=1 every cell; G check pooled 0, own-seed 0, premise 0 (C 1,717); the read re-run on the host reproduces results/read/split.txt byte for byte. Price-bearing per-arm files in the private dayfine/trading-results at b46c88db, same paths.")
